@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix qb:   <http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#> .
@prefix eg:   <http://example.org/ns#> .

eg:ds eg:unit eg:persons ; qb:structure eg:dsd .
eg:dsd a qb:DataStructureDefinition ;
    qb:component [ qb:dimension eg:area ] ,
                 [ qb:measure eg:pop ] ,
                 [ qb:attribute eg:unit ; qb:componentRequired "true"^^xsd:boolean ; qb:componentAttachment qb:DataSet ] .
eg:area a qb:DimensionProperty ; rdfs:range skos:Concept ; qb:codeList eg:areas .
eg:pop a qb:MeasureProperty .
eg:unit a qb:AttributeProperty .
eg:areas a skos:ConceptScheme .
eg:a1 a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme eg:areas .
eg:a2 a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme eg:areas .
eg:a3 a skos:Concept .
eg:o1 qb:dataSet eg:ds ; eg:area eg:a1 ; eg:pop 10 .
eg:o2 qb:dataSet eg:ds ; eg:area eg:a2 ; eg:pop 20 .
